sue_severity":"HIGH"},"components":[{"path":"SKILL.md","type":"markdown","lines":457,"executable":false,"size_bytes":20474,"source_url":null,"source_identity":null,"source_digest":null}],"structured_summaries":[],"issues":[{"id":"PE3","finding_id":"finding-a796ce8e67cd430f8b5d307ee7cccaa3","category":"Privilege Escalation","pattern":"Credential Access","severity":"HIGH","confidence":0.7,"location":{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":109,"end_line":null},"finding":"Get API key from","explanation":"Code accesses credential files (SSH keys, AWS credentials, etc.). This could indicate credential theft attempts.","remediation":"Remove references to credential paths. Use environment variables or secrets managers. For docs, use placeholder paths (e.g., /path/to/config). Never load .env or token files in production code paths.","code_snippet":"export CELLCOG_API_KEY=\"sk_...\"\n```\n\nGet API key from: https://cellcog.ai/profile?tab=api-keys\n\n```python\nstatus = client.get_account_status()","intent":null,"tags":["Privilege Escalation","llm-unconfirmed"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":"ba33945a320ed9dcd72067274398f06fc426d6f50c23a22c52f775c0eb07d2e8","occurrences":[{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":109,"end_line":null}]},{"id":"SQP-1","finding_id":"finding-d397845f94ac41c8846f1ca1db08f93f","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.94,"location":{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":3,"end_line":3},"finding":null,"explanation":"The manifest description is extremely broad ('any-to-any', 'all your work gets done, not just code'), which can cause the platform to invoke this skill for a wide range of unrelated user requests. In a skill that can upload local files, write files to disk, browse with a real browser profile, and access connected SaaS tools, over-broad routing materially increases the chance of unintended data exposure or side effects.","remediation":"Narrow the description to explicit, high-signal use cases and required user intent, such as 'Use for e